        195,
        442,
        916,
        495
      ],
      "margin_number": 162,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "You have already met participles based on the present stem of verbs, e.g. βλέπων, ‘looking’, τρέχων, ‘running’. Greek also has participles based on the aorist stem of verbs.",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "order": 7,
      "bbox": [
        195,
        514,
        366,
        529
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "First aorist stems",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 8,
      "bbox": [
        195,
        539,
        841,
        553
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "The aorist participle is based on the aorist stem. To form the aorist stem:",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "box",
      "order": 9,
      "bbox": [
        92,
        561,
        916,
        617
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "• Take the aorist indicative;\n• Remove the augment;\n• Remove the personal endings, e.g.",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "order": 10,
      "bbox": [
        259,
        628,
        542,
        677
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "ἔ-παυσα > aorist stem: παυσα-\nἤ-κουσα > aorist stem: ἀκουσα-\nἀπ-ε-κρινά-μην > aorist stem: ἀποκρινα-",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
